  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-family:Arial\">\n  <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/resourcepacks/minecarts-with-wheels-faithful/logo.webp\" alt=\"礦車加輪子：忠實版 Logo\"><br><br>\n  <h2 style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:32px\">為礦車加上會轉動的輪子！- 現已支援 32x 解析度</h2>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fewanhowell.com%252fresourcepacks%252fminecarts-with-wheels-faithful\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size:20px;line-height:40px;color:#1ea1f1;display:block\" rel=\"nofollow\">在我的網站上查看資源包！</a>\n  <br>\n  <p>你曾經覺得 Minecraft 裡的礦車看起來太呆板嗎？這款資源包就是為你量身打造的！</p><p>此資源包為礦車加上了會實際轉動的輪子。當礦車移動時，輪子也會隨之旋轉。礦車跑得越快，輪子轉動的速度就越快！</p>\n  <br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1295/90/left-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"帶輪子的礦車\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1295/91/right-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"帶輪子的礦車（再次）\"><br>\n  <br>\n  <div>⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯</div>\n  <br>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.ewanhowell.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/discord.png\" width=\"48\">\n    <div style=\"line-height:6px\"></div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:20px;text-decoration:underline;color:#5662f6\">加入我的 Discord 伺服器！</p>\n  </a>\n  <div style=\"line-height:12px\"></div>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fresourcepacks.ewanhowell.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/discord.png\" width=\"48\">\n    <div style=\"line-height:6px\"></div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:20px;text-decoration:underline;color:#5662f6\">加入資源包開發 Discord 伺服器！</p>\n  </a>\n  <div style=\"line-height:12px\"></div>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@EwanHowell\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/